v 3
d exactnl: Exact likelihood correction for nested logit share-form estimation
d
d Authors: Matthew J. Baker and Lisa M. George
d
d exactnl implements the exact-likelihood correction for the Berry share-form
d nested logit estimator with variable choice sets, adding the
d (J-1)ln(1-sigma) Jacobian term that the linear IV regression discards.
d Supports fixed-effect absorption and a control-function price instrument.
d
d If you use this command, please cite:
d Baker, Matthew J. and Lisa M. George. Demand Estimation with Variable
d Choice Sets: A Likelihood Correction for BLP Models. Working paper.
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260710
d
f exactnl.ado
f exactnl.sthlp
